<title>USA: Abrams names Garrett CFO.</title>
<headline>Abrams names Garrett CFO.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Abrams Industries Inc said its board has elected Melinda Garrett as chief financial officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The company said its board has also declared a regular quarterly dividend of $0.02 per share, payable March 19, record February 6.</p>
